  "prefLabel": "Opt 104.01 Record of Board Actions",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-03-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 104.01 Record of Board Actions. Minutes shall be kept of all board meetings and all official actions taken by the board. These minutes shall record those members who participate in each vote and shall separately record the position of any members who choose to dissent, abstain, or concur. Board minutes shall be public records and shall be available for inspection in compliance with RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94, EXPIRED: 6-17-00\n\nNew. #7370, INTERIM, eff 9-30-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-01\n\nNew. #7607, eff 12-5-01; ss by #14211, eff 5-10-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/opt100-600.html"
